<title>USA: Gull Labs to buy Fresenius AG division.</title>
<headline>Gull Labs to buy Fresenius AG division.</headline>
<dateline>SALT LAKE CITY 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gull Laboratories Inc said on Friday that it plans to acquire the Germany-based diagnostic business of the Fresenius Intensive Care and Diagnostics Division.</p>
<p>The company said that the new Gull Laboratories and Fresenius combination would increase its worldwide sales by 40 percent. The consolidation would also enhance operating income and profitability in the succeeding years,.</p>
<p>Gull Laboratories expects to reach its targeted goal of $100 million in revenues in the next four to five years.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
